  "status_text": "Two limits on a rulebook now have one exact test. Lean checked when a rulebook can tell whether any pair of lights is fully on, under limits on the number of clauses and the size of each. Pick a set of hidden-switch rules with no setting that passes them all. Dropping any one rule must let some setting through. Assign every visible pair to one hidden rule. Each assigned pair adds one entry to the clauses that rule produces and doubles their number. There is a rulebook within both limits exactly when some such set and assignment fit them (L-lib-1136).",
